semantic_boundary_contrasts:
  core_nuance: 支 is the precise measure word for rigid, slender, rod-like tools (arrows, pens, firearms) and musical pieces.
  contrasts[3]{id,compared_word,pinyin,analysis}:
    1 | 支 vs. 根 | gēn | 支 classifies thin, rigid, manufactured instruments (一支箭, 一支笔, 一支枪), whereas 根 classifies flexible, fibrous, or natural slender items (一根绳子, 一根头发, 一根竹子).
    2 | 支 vs. 把 | bǎ | 支 is for cylindrical slender tools, while 把 is for items featuring a grasping handle (一把刀, 一把扇子, 一把雨伞).
    3 | 支 vs. 首 | shǒu | Both count music/poems, but 支 is often used for instrumental melodies or popular songs (一支歌), while 首 is formal for poetic stanzas and formal anthems (一首诗, 一首国歌).

extended_reading_passages[2]{id,hanzi,pinyin,en,es}:
  #1 | 案头的一支斑竹毛笔，承载着数代文人墨客的幽微心事。蘸饱浓淡适宜的青墨，笔尖在宣纸上挥洒出崇山峻岭与流云飞瀑。这一支小小的毛笔，不仅记录着岁月的更迭，更传承着中华传统书画艺术的千古神韵。 | Àntóu de yì zhī bānzhú máobǐ, chéngzài zhe shù dài wénrén-mòkè de yōuwēi xīnshì. Zhànbǎo nóngdàn shìyí de qīngmò, bǐjiān zài xuānzhǐ shàng huīsǎ chū chóngshān-jùnlǐng yǔ liúyún-fēipù. Zhè yì zhī xiǎoxiǎo de máobǐ, bùjǐn jìlù zhe suìyuè de gēngdié, gèng chuánchéng zhe Zhōnghuá chuántǒng shūhuà yìshù de qiāngǔ shényùn. | A speckled bamboo brush on the desk cradles the nuanced musings of literati generations. Dipped in ink, its tip splashes craggy peaks and waterfalls across rice paper. This tiny brush records the passage of years and inherits calligraphy's timeless charm. | Una pluma de bambú sobre el escritorio custodia los desvelos de generaciones de letrados. Impregnada en tinta china, su punta traza riscos y cascadas sobre papel de arroz. Este modesto pincel perpetúa el alma imperecedera de la caligrafía clásica.
  #2 | 在抗震救灾的生死关头，一支训练有素、装备精良的国家紧急救援队伍在第一时间抵达灾区核心地带。他们日夜奋战在废墟瓦砾之中，为抢救人民生命财产筑起一道坚不可摧的生命防线，谱写了英雄壮歌。 | Zài kàngzhèn-jiùzāi de shēngsǐ guāntóu, yì zhī xùnliàn-yǒusù, zhuāngbèi-jīngliáng de guójiā jǐnjí jiùyuán duìwù zài dì-yī shíjiān dǐdá zāiqū héxīn dìdài. Tāmen rìyè fènzhàn zài fèixū-wǎlì zhīzhōng, wèi qiǎngjiù rénmín shēngmìng cáichǎn zhùqǐ yí dào jiānbùkěcuī de shēngmìng fángxiàn, pǔxiě le yīngxióng zhuànggē. | At the life-or-death juncture of earthquake relief, a well-trained, well-equipped national emergency team arrived at the disaster core. Laboring day and night among ruins, they built an impregnable lifeline, composing a heroic anthem. | En la hora crítica del auxilio tras el sismo, un cuerpo de rescate nacional bien adiestrado y pertrechado arribó con presteza al epicentro. Bregando día y noche entre escombros, tendió un escudo salvador en defensa del pueblo, entonando una gesta heroica.
